{"sectionId":"genetics/mendel","items":[{"id":"genetics--mendel-k001","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"이배체에서 대립유전자는 감수분열 동안 분리된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k002","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"다른 염색체에 있는 유전자 또는 충분히 멀리 떨어진 유전자는 독립적으로 분리되는 것으로 근사할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k003","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"Aa×Aa에서 유전자형 비는 1:2:1이고 완전우성 표현형 비는 3:1이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k004","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"AaBb×AaBb에서 두 좌위가 독립이고 완전우성이면 9:3:3:1이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k005","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"검정교배는 우성 표현형 개체를 열성 동형접합체와 교배하여 유전자형을 추론한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k006","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"불완전우성은 이형접합체의 중간 표현형, 공동우성은 두 대립유전자 산물의 동시 발현이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k007","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"ABO 혈액형에서 Iᴬ와 Iᴮ는 공동우성이고 i에 우성이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k008","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"복대립은 집단에 세 개 이상의 대립유전자가 존재하는 경우이며 개인은 보통 두 개를 갖는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k009","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"상위성은 한 좌위가 다른 좌위의 표현형을 바꾸는 현상으로 열성 상위성 9:3:4 등 다양한 비가 나타난다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k010","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"침투도는 유전자형 보유자 중 표현형 발현 비율, 표현도는 발현 정도다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k011","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"분리법칙과 독립법칙을 구별한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k012","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"다인자 유전은 여러 유전자와 환경 영향을 받을 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k013","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"치사 유전자형은 살아 있는 자손의 분리비를 바꾼다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k014","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"우성은 빈도·적응도·정상 여부와 동일하지 않다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"genetics--mendel-k015","sectionId":"genetics/mendel","unitId":"genetics","subject":"biology","text":"1:1:1:1이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}